WEBVTT

00:00:01.580 --> 00:00:03.710
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:00:03.870 --> 00:00:05.670
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:00:06.210 --> 00:00:08.730
<b>GO, GO, GO, GO, LET'S GO!!</b>

00:00:15.720 --> 00:00:20.470
<b>Kinou made no ruuru kyou wa tada no ruuzu</b>

00:00:15.720 --> 00:00:20.470
<i>Yesterday’s rules are simply loose today</i>

00:00:20.470 --> 00:00:24.770
<b>Kowashite dantotsu gooru</b>

00:00:20.470 --> 00:00:24.770
<i>The best goal is to break them</i>

00:00:25.150 --> 00:00:27.560
<b>hashiri tudukete nai to</b>

00:00:25.150 --> 00:00:27.560
<i>If I don’t keep running</i>

00:00:27.560 --> 00:00:29.900
<b>hokani imi wa nai to</b>

00:00:27.560 --> 00:00:29.900
<i>There’s no other meaning</i>

00:00:29.900 --> 00:00:34.240
<b>Panku na tetsukaku nanda</b>

00:00:29.900 --> 00:00:34.240
<i>It’s a punk philosophy</i>

00:00:34.610 --> 00:00:39.330
<b>Baiorizumu wa tsuubai rizumu de</b>

00:00:34.610 --> 00:00:39.330
<i>Biorhythm is a two-time rhythm</i>

00:00:39.330 --> 00:00:43.460
<b>Fuukei wa shunkan ni musuu no sen</b>

00:00:39.330 --> 00:00:43.460
<i>The scenery instantly becomes countless lines</i>

00:00:43.460 --> 00:00:46.330
<b>Ore wo torimaku kaze</b>

00:00:43.460 --> 00:00:46.330
<i>The wind envelops me</i>

00:00:48.710 --> 00:00:51.050
<b>Inside Outside semete</b>

00:00:48.710 --> 00:00:51.050
<i>Inside Outside attack</i>

00:00:51.050 --> 00:00:53.420
<b>Issai gassai nuite</b>

00:00:51.050 --> 00:00:53.420
<i>Surpass everything altogether</i>

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:55.570
<b>Dare hitori monani hitotsu mo</b>

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:58.100
<i>I won’t let no one and nothing go forward</i>

00:00:55.570 --> 00:00:58.100
<b>Mae wo ikasetaku wa nai</b>

00:00:58.100 --> 00:01:00.430
<b>Inside Outside GO! SONIC!!</b>

00:00:58.100 --> 00:01:00.430
<i>Inside Outside, Go! Sonic!!</i>

00:01:00.430 --> 00:01:02.850
<b>Issai gassai Yes! SONIC!!</b>

00:01:00.430 --> 00:01:02.850
<i>Everything altogether Yes! Sonic!!</i>

00:01:02.850 --> 00:01:05.890
<b>Abunai yo to Have A Nice wa niteru</b>

00:01:02.850 --> 00:01:05.890
<i>“Watch out” and “Have a nice” are similar</i>

00:01:05.890 --> 00:01:08.650
<b>Soudochira mo kamihitoe na no sa</b>

00:01:05.890 --> 00:01:08.650
<i>That’s right – both are by the skin of your teeth</i>

00:01:08.650 --> 00:01:16.660
<b>Taikutsu nugisuteteima sugu kakedase</b>

00:01:08.650 --> 00:01:16.660
<i>Throw boredom away and start running right now</i>

00:01:20.530 --> 00:01:22.410
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:01:22.740 --> 00:01:24.750
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:01:25.100 --> 00:01:28.920
<b>GO, GO, GO, GO, LET'S GO!!</b>

00:01:30.590 --> 00:01:36.010
Day 1       13:27

00:01:30.590 --> 00:01:36.010
Above the Capital City

00:01:30.900 --> 00:01:35.400
We're currently heading south above the city. Nothing out of the ordinary.

00:01:36.400 --> 00:01:40.120
This is Control. We've verified the position of your craft.

00:01:40.120 --> 00:01:42.990
Report on the captured hedgehog's status.

00:01:44.540 --> 00:01:46.120
Did you say something?

00:01:46.120 --> 00:01:47.080
What?

00:01:47.080 --> 00:01:53.590
I heard you caused chaos at Prison Island, but you're being a good boy today.

00:01:53.590 --> 00:01:55.920
I don't know what you're talking about.

00:01:56.510 --> 00:02:01.510
If you keep up that attitude because you're famous now, you're gonna be in a world of hurt.

00:02:03.220 --> 00:02:05.810
We'll arrive at GUN in approximately 30 minutes.

00:02:09.190 --> 00:02:10.480
What's the ruckus?

00:02:10.480 --> 00:02:12.610
What's going on?

00:02:16.400 --> 00:02:19.280
I prefer running.

00:02:20.490 --> 00:02:22.700
The hedgehog has escaped!

00:02:38.760 --> 00:02:40.050
Sorry!

00:02:40.410 --> 00:02:45.410
Episode 34

00:02:40.410 --> 00:02:45.410
Sonic the Fugitive

00:02:46.600 --> 00:02:48.270
Target acquired!

00:02:48.270 --> 00:02:49.810
Dispatch the GUN robots!

00:02:49.810 --> 00:02:51.270
Roger!

00:03:01.030 --> 00:03:02.740
Oh my!

00:03:14.590 --> 00:03:16.710
Damn, if this keeps up…

00:03:22.890 --> 00:03:24.930
It stinks really bad.

00:03:25.510 --> 00:03:30.430
Anyway, how did I get wrapped up in this mess?

00:03:31.060 --> 00:03:33.350
But I guess things will eventually work out.

00:03:37.940 --> 00:03:41.030
You're from Station Square, right?

00:03:41.780 --> 00:03:42.320
Yeah.

00:03:42.320 --> 00:03:45.320
So have you ever seen Sonic?

00:03:45.910 --> 00:03:48.660
Well... Yeah...

00:03:49.120 --> 00:03:50.000
What's he like?

00:03:50.000 --> 00:03:51.830
Is he really awesome?

00:03:51.830 --> 00:03:53.920
He sure is!

00:03:54.960 --> 00:03:59.800
I'll bet he's busy right now.

00:04:00.760 --> 00:04:03.470
I want to meet him too!

00:04:03.470 --> 00:04:05.180
I'm sure you'll get your chance.

00:04:05.180 --> 00:04:11.270
Yeah! If I become friends with Sonic, I'll introduce him to you first.

00:04:12.060 --> 00:04:13.100
Bye!

00:04:13.560 --> 00:04:14.560
Bye.

00:04:19.610 --> 00:04:21.360
Sonic...

00:04:22.030 --> 00:04:24.610
Will we meet again soon?

00:04:29.740 --> 00:04:36.830
As for code name “Director's” travels, I've contacted relevant personnel in each area so that he can get around easily.

00:04:38.590 --> 00:04:39.750
Good work.

00:04:40.420 --> 00:04:43.800
And about the case we talked about a while ago...

00:04:44.260 --> 00:04:49.390
There was damage to some buildings and stores, but no one was hurt.

00:04:49.760 --> 00:04:52.770
What's become of our hero?

00:04:53.180 --> 00:04:55.020
He caused quite a commotion.

00:04:55.440 --> 00:04:59.730
I don't think the government should stay quiet any longer.

00:04:59.770 --> 00:05:03.150
I know, but I can't believe Sonic would do that.

00:05:03.150 --> 00:05:05.280
It must be a mistake.

00:05:06.740 --> 00:05:09.030
A true hero doesn't betray the trust of people.

00:05:09.030 --> 00:05:13.910
As the head of this nation, you should know that.

00:05:14.830 --> 00:05:15.920
Yeah.

00:05:16.580 --> 00:05:22.920
He's a beast that's unfit to live in our world.

00:05:22.920 --> 00:05:24.670
You think so?

00:05:24.670 --> 00:05:26.010
I'm positive.

00:05:28.340 --> 00:05:29.720
What are you doing?

00:05:29.720 --> 00:05:31.350
Be careful!

00:05:31.350 --> 00:05:33.890
A cat just crossed the street.

00:05:34.790 --> 00:05:38.290
Day 1       19:30

00:05:34.790 --> 00:05:38.290
The National
Museum of Art

00:06:24.980 --> 00:06:27.190
Mr. President, there's a new situation.

00:06:27.190 --> 00:06:31.780
Sonic stole the Chaos Emerald at the National Museum of Art.

00:06:31.780 --> 00:06:33.240
What?

00:06:33.240 --> 00:06:36.080
Please give me your instructions.

00:06:36.080 --> 00:06:37.660
I have no other choice.

00:06:37.660 --> 00:06:39.460
Start a criminal investigation.

00:06:39.670 --> 00:06:41.170
Understood.

00:06:41.170 --> 00:06:44.250
I will notify all divisions immediately.

00:06:46.740 --> 00:06:50.200
Day 1      20:05

00:06:46.740 --> 00:06:50.200
GUN Headquarters
Central Command Room

00:06:47.510 --> 00:06:49.550
We received permission from the President.

00:06:50.430 --> 00:06:54.310
Dispatch all Beetle Troops into the tunnels beneath the old urban district.

00:07:06.570 --> 00:07:09.030
Here's a special report.

00:07:09.030 --> 00:07:17.540
Someone stole the Chaos Emerald that was displayed at the National Museum of Art.

00:07:17.540 --> 00:07:22.460
Here's footage of the culprit from the museum's infrared camera.

00:07:29.970 --> 00:07:30.970
Sonic!

00:07:30.970 --> 00:07:34.890
It's a lie! Sonic is not a thief!

00:07:38.140 --> 00:07:41.640
But no matter how you look at it, that's Sonic.

00:07:41.640 --> 00:07:42.560
Grandpa!

00:07:42.560 --> 00:07:43.440
Mr. Thorndyke!

00:07:43.440 --> 00:07:44.360
Chuck!

00:07:46.270 --> 00:07:47.860
Sorry.

00:07:47.860 --> 00:07:50.150
It's because the thief looks just like him.

00:07:50.650 --> 00:07:56.280
The authorities have announced that the criminal is Sonic the Hedgehog.

00:07:56.700 --> 00:08:02.290
He destroyed many GUN robots, and he's currently on the run.

00:08:03.040 --> 00:08:06.840
This is absurd!

00:08:06.840 --> 00:08:09.840
It's not true.

00:08:09.840 --> 00:08:12.130
Everything will be fine, Chris.

00:08:12.130 --> 00:08:14.800
This has to be a mistake.

00:08:21.310 --> 00:08:24.600
What happened, Sonic?

00:08:47.270 --> 00:08:51.230
Day 1       20:24

00:08:47.270 --> 00:08:51.230
City Tunnels

00:08:51.260 --> 00:08:53.630
Sonic is a thief?

00:08:53.630 --> 00:08:55.220
You've gotta be kidding.

00:08:55.220 --> 00:08:57.300
You guys don't know anything.

00:08:57.300 --> 00:09:00.100
It's his fault I'm in this predicament.

00:09:00.100 --> 00:09:04.480
He's bad luck not only to me, but to this entire nation!

00:09:05.230 --> 00:09:06.650
How dare you!

00:09:07.230 --> 00:09:11.070
Rumor says that he also caused quite a commotion on Prison Island.

00:09:11.070 --> 00:09:14.950
That place is a top secret GUN facility!

00:09:14.950 --> 00:09:16.820
You're still talking, punk?

00:09:16.820 --> 00:09:19.030
What are you doing? Let me go!

00:09:19.030 --> 00:09:20.080
Me and Vivian...

00:09:20.030 --> 00:09:22.580
Enough with this Vivian!

00:09:20.080 --> 00:09:22.540
Stop insulting Vivian and me!

00:09:43.600 --> 00:09:47.140
I doubt you have the news credentials to enter here.

00:09:47.480 --> 00:09:51.360
It's fine. I already received permission.

00:10:00.870 --> 00:10:03.370
Who on Earth are you?

00:10:03.370 --> 00:10:05.830
That's a secret.

00:10:13.670 --> 00:10:17.630
Have you heard of “Project Shadow”?

00:10:17.630 --> 00:10:19.760
I can't give you the details.

00:10:19.760 --> 00:10:25.310
Or to be more accurate, no one knows the details. However...

00:10:39.150 --> 00:10:42.280
This is footage from an incident last night.

00:10:42.280 --> 00:10:48.330
The way I see it, Sonic has teamed up with Eggman to steal the secrets of “Project Shadow”.

00:10:48.330 --> 00:10:51.080
That's why we captured him.

00:10:51.080 --> 00:10:52.920
And he got away.

00:10:53.420 --> 00:10:57.340
We will arrest him and restore GUN's honor!

00:11:19.900 --> 00:11:20.740
Take this!

00:11:23.070 --> 00:11:24.450
That takes care of that!

00:11:34.750 --> 00:11:36.670
The star makes its entrance.

00:11:36.670 --> 00:11:38.710
Then I'll also use this!

00:11:41.760 --> 00:11:44.510
It's pointless! I can see the bullets!

00:11:51.190 --> 00:11:53.150
You're reckless.

00:12:06.990 --> 00:12:10.290
For a star, you lost pretty quickly.

00:12:20.760 --> 00:12:22.010
What?

00:12:23.220 --> 00:12:28.760
I see. We actually do look alike.

00:12:28.760 --> 00:12:32.480
It's like looking in a mirror.

00:12:32.480 --> 00:12:37.230
So you're the one who's been pretending to be me and causing chaos everywhere.

00:12:37.520 --> 00:12:39.480
You impostor!

00:12:46.950 --> 00:12:48.740
A black Sonic.

00:12:48.740 --> 00:12:51.540
No, he's not Sonic.

00:12:51.950 --> 00:12:55.540
Is this Eggman's doing? Or is this someone else's trap?

00:13:05.970 --> 00:13:10.220
I'm the impostor? Aren't you the fake?

00:13:10.220 --> 00:13:14.140
Actually, we're on completely different levels to acknowledge you as a fake.

00:13:14.140 --> 00:13:17.190
You won't be talking tough for much longer!

00:13:26.660 --> 00:13:29.990
You're pretty good, but let's take this to the city.

00:13:30.450 --> 00:13:32.450
Can you keep up with me?

00:13:43.170 --> 00:13:45.510
What? Okay, I understand.

00:13:45.510 --> 00:13:48.680
If you hear anything new, let me know.

00:13:48.680 --> 00:13:50.800
That was Nelson.

00:13:50.800 --> 00:13:55.430
Sonic is fighting a GUN robot on Downhill Street.

00:13:56.690 --> 00:13:58.150
Chris!

00:13:58.440 --> 00:14:00.440
Please excuse me, Mr. Thorndyke.

00:14:01.020 --> 00:14:03.190
Wait! I'm going too!

00:14:13.370 --> 00:14:14.870
You're going to lose.

00:14:15.370 --> 00:14:16.710
What?

00:14:17.660 --> 00:14:18.960
That's pointless.

00:14:38.100 --> 00:14:39.690
What's going on?

00:14:43.110 --> 00:14:45.690
Sonic is surprised.

00:14:46.360 --> 00:14:48.150
I don't blame him.

00:14:48.150 --> 00:14:53.530
When I first saw him, I also thought he was Sonic.

00:15:03.670 --> 00:15:05.340
You're Sonic!

00:15:05.340 --> 00:15:08.760
How dare you trick me!

00:15:09.970 --> 00:15:11.970
Actually, you're not him.

00:15:19.020 --> 00:15:21.690
My name is Shadow.

00:15:21.690 --> 00:15:30.240
In appreciation for awakening me, I'll grant you your wish, Dr. Eggman.

00:15:35.330 --> 00:15:37.240
What bad timing!

00:15:37.240 --> 00:15:39.910
Witness my power!

00:15:43.420 --> 00:15:45.590
It's no use, Sonic.

00:15:45.590 --> 00:15:49.510
Shadow surpasses you in every way!

00:15:49.510 --> 00:15:54.390
You're about to learn that the hard way!

00:16:03.400 --> 00:16:04.980
The Chaos Emerald!

00:16:05.190 --> 00:16:09.610
What are you planning to do with that Chaos Emerald, you impostor?

00:16:12.070 --> 00:16:14.280
I've heard about you.

00:16:14.280 --> 00:16:17.700
But it seems I overestimated you.

00:16:24.540 --> 00:16:26.710
There's someone faster than me?

00:16:26.710 --> 00:16:29.250
That's not speed. He warped!

00:16:29.250 --> 00:16:30.800
That means...

00:16:31.300 --> 00:16:34.590
Witness my power.

00:16:35.300 --> 00:16:36.510
That's…

00:16:37.680 --> 00:16:39.560
Chaos Control.

00:16:46.440 --> 00:16:49.230
He's doing Chaos Control with just one Emerald?

00:16:49.230 --> 00:16:51.570
Who is he?

00:17:05.500 --> 00:17:06.960
Sonic!

00:17:08.290 --> 00:17:10.250
You fight dirty!

00:17:10.590 --> 00:17:12.960
Consider yourself fortunate.

00:17:12.960 --> 00:17:16.470
If it wasn't for the limiter on my arm, you'd be dead.

00:17:18.800 --> 00:17:27.980
Professor Gerald gave me the power of Chaos Control. I'm Shadow, the greatest life form.

00:17:28.940 --> 00:17:31.650
Is that all you want to say?

00:17:34.570 --> 00:17:37.660
I'm done playing.

00:17:37.660 --> 00:17:41.120
Adios, Sonic the Hedgehog.

00:17:41.120 --> 00:17:43.200
Chaos Control!

00:17:49.920 --> 00:17:51.550
This is a message for Sonic.

00:17:51.550 --> 00:17:53.380
You're completely surrounded.

00:17:53.420 --> 00:17:55.590
Calmly surrender.

00:17:56.090 --> 00:18:00.300
Do you really think that's enough to capture me?

00:18:01.180 --> 00:18:03.680
Shut up! I'll let you think until the count to five!

00:18:03.680 --> 00:18:04.930
Five!

00:18:04.930 --> 00:18:05.930
Four!

00:18:05.930 --> 00:18:06.890
Three!

00:18:06.890 --> 00:18:08.650
Please stop, Sonic!

00:18:09.060 --> 00:18:12.320
If you keep fighting, you'll…

00:18:15.070 --> 00:18:16.650
Sonic...

00:18:17.860 --> 00:18:22.030
Get back! That's the beast!

00:18:22.030 --> 00:18:28.080
He's dangerous unless he's locked up in a special cell on Prison Island!

00:18:28.120 --> 00:18:30.250
Prison Island?

00:18:30.250 --> 00:18:31.590
So what?

00:18:31.960 --> 00:18:34.800
Are you taking me there?

00:18:34.800 --> 00:18:37.050
Preparations have already been made!

00:18:37.050 --> 00:18:40.430
Chris, you're right.

00:18:40.430 --> 00:18:43.350
I'll calmly surrender.

00:18:43.760 --> 00:18:45.270
Get him!

00:18:45.270 --> 00:18:47.980
Take it easy, okay?

00:18:49.140 --> 00:18:52.730
Chaos Control? You must be kidding.

00:18:52.730 --> 00:18:54.730
He's such a fake!

00:18:54.730 --> 00:18:58.610
The next time we meet, let's battle fair and square without any tricks!

00:18:58.610 --> 00:19:00.910
Got that, Shadow?

00:19:06.450 --> 00:19:08.080
Don't worry.

00:19:08.080 --> 00:19:10.540
We'll meet again soon, buddy!

00:19:11.420 --> 00:19:13.080
Sonic...

00:19:20.680 --> 00:19:23.640
I won't let anyone get in my way.

00:19:23.120 --> 00:19:29.040
Day 1      21:30

00:19:23.120 --> 00:19:29.040
Downhill Street

00:19:23.640 --> 00:19:26.430
Right, Maria?

00:19:29.480 --> 00:19:30.810
Are you ready?

00:19:31.770 --> 00:19:35.940
You did it! You really did it!

00:19:36.480 --> 00:19:39.990
You did a great job, Shadow!

00:19:39.990 --> 00:19:41.780
He's incredibly happy.

00:19:41.780 --> 00:19:45.080
It's the first time he's won, so I guess it can't be helped.

00:19:45.080 --> 00:19:46.660
By the way, Doctor...

00:19:46.660 --> 00:19:55.630
In order to rule the world using the ultimate weapon Eclipse Cannon, you need five more Chaos Emeralds.

00:19:56.420 --> 00:19:56.960
What?

00:19:57.590 --> 00:19:59.260
Oh yeah, you're right.

00:19:59.260 --> 00:20:02.590
So what's the next plan?

00:20:02.590 --> 00:20:06.260
Dr. Eggman, you have a guest! Here!

00:20:08.520 --> 00:20:11.430
Long time no see, Dr. Eggman.

00:20:11.430 --> 00:20:16.110
I have something interesting to tell you, so will you meet me?

00:20:16.110 --> 00:20:18.230
She said, 'Long time no see'.

00:20:18.230 --> 00:20:20.320
She seems suspicious.

00:20:20.320 --> 00:20:21.440
How dare you say that!

00:20:21.440 --> 00:20:23.240
Bring her immediately!

00:20:23.240 --> 00:20:24.490
Not again.

00:20:24.490 --> 00:20:25.450
Huh?

00:20:27.410 --> 00:20:30.200
It didn't hurt because I'm used to this!

00:20:30.200 --> 00:20:32.620
Yeah, I don't feel pain anymore either.

00:20:32.620 --> 00:20:35.630
I'm fine too! Just fine!

00:20:37.630 --> 00:20:40.420
You're so rowdy.

00:20:43.130 --> 00:20:45.220
Mademoiselle!

00:20:45.220 --> 00:20:47.260
I heard what happened.

00:20:47.260 --> 00:20:50.100
It seems you need my help.

00:20:51.890 --> 00:20:53.810
The Chaos Emerald!

00:20:54.100 --> 00:20:58.570
I may not look the part, but I'm a treasure hunter that specializes in gems.

00:20:58.570 --> 00:21:05.780
Depending on the terms, I may tell you the location of the other Chaos Emeralds.

00:21:08.740 --> 00:21:11.450
All right, what are your terms?

00:21:16.960 --> 00:21:18.710
We have a deal.

00:21:19.130 --> 00:21:22.630
I'm Rouge the Bat, but just call me Rouge.

00:21:22.630 --> 00:21:23.670
And who are you?

00:21:24.880 --> 00:21:26.720
Shadow.

00:21:27.640 --> 00:21:30.010
Shadow the Hedgehog.

00:21:35.460 --> 00:21:39.210
Day 2        6:03

00:21:35.460 --> 00:21:39.210
City Harbor

00:21:44.650 --> 00:21:47.240
Sonic let himself be caught on purpose.

00:21:47.240 --> 00:21:50.620
I need to know why.

00:21:50.910 --> 00:21:54.540
I understand. Be careful.

00:21:55.040 --> 00:21:57.920
But why are we dressed in this outfit?

00:21:57.920 --> 00:22:01.000
This is the standard outfit for infiltrating enemy territory.

00:22:04.800 --> 00:22:06.670
Speed up!

00:22:06.670 --> 00:22:09.680
Sonic's waiting for me to rescue him!

00:22:09.680 --> 00:22:11.350
I wonder if that's true...

00:22:11.350 --> 00:22:12.850
Did you say something?

00:22:13.390 --> 00:22:15.180
I didn't say anything!

00:22:17.710 --> 00:22:22.210
Day 2   6:30

00:22:17.710 --> 00:22:22.210
Prison Island Deluxe Suite

00:22:22.270 --> 00:22:26.360
With one thing after another, today was really hectic.

00:22:26.780 --> 00:22:34.200
Although I let myself be caught on purpose, this place is heavily booby-trapped against me.

00:22:45.070 --> 00:22:54.450
<b>Watashitachi no sekai wa mahou o kakerarete</b>

00:22:45.070 --> 00:22:54.450
<i>There’s magic cast on our world.</i>

00:22:54.450 --> 00:23:03.420
<b>Ai suru to kime kisae namida ni ujirareteru</b>

00:22:54.450 --> 00:23:03.420
<i>The nervousness of love is sealed by tears.</i>

00:23:03.420 --> 00:23:12.300
<b>Boy boy futari de jumon wo sagashi ni ikou</b>

00:23:03.420 --> 00:23:12.300
<i>Boy, let’s search for a spell together,</i>

00:23:12.300 --> 00:23:21.900
<b>Kinji rareta yume wo kanaerareru kuni he</b>

00:23:12.300 --> 00:23:21.900
<i>To a land where our forbidden dreams can come true.</i>

00:23:22.770 --> 00:23:30.840
<b>Dare ni mo naisho de ashita na tchi awaseshiyou</b>

00:23:22.770 --> 00:23:30.840
<i>Let’s secretly meet tomorrow.</i>

00:23:31.450 --> 00:23:41.040
<b>Itsuka kotori wo ume ta yowake no mieru oka de</b>

00:23:31.450 --> 00:23:41.040
<i>At the place where we buried the bird, the hill where we can see the sunrise.</i>

00:23:41.620 --> 00:23:49.800
<b>Tsumetai asamoya kimi to te wo tsunaidara</b>

00:23:41.620 --> 00:23:49.800
<i>In the cold morning mist, if I hold hands with you.</i>

00:23:50.550 --> 00:23:58.970
<b>Hikaru michi no fuuin ga tokeru yo</b>

00:23:50.550 --> 00:23:58.970
<i>The seal to the shining path will be broken.</i>

00:23:59.520 --> 00:24:03.810
<b>Hateshinaku</b>

00:23:59.520 --> 00:24:03.810
<i>Forever...</i>

00:24:30.010 --> 00:25:35.360
Escape from Prison Island
